DevOps Engineer.
Responsibilities:
Provide technical support for Lenovo applications, develop automation solutions;
Collaborate with cross-functional teams; Build and maintain scripts for CI/CD;
Troubleshoot and perform root cause analysis; Monitor system performance;
Stay updated with emerging technologies. Skills: Linux/Unix, MySQL/MongoDB/Redis/PostgreSQL, Git/Jenkins/ArgoCD/Nexus, Nginx/Tomcat/Docker/Kubernetes, ELK/Splunk/Prometheus/Grafana, Perl/Python/Java/Bash/Ansible/Chef/Terraform, F5/firewall/DNS, SSL/AWS/Azure/basic AI.
Requirements:
Bachelor’s in IT or related, 3-5+ years DevOps experience; proficient in Linux administration and scripting;
Familiar with
 Java/JVM
, 
Agile/Scrum
, 
CI/CD
;
Strong problem-solving and communication skills;
Fluent in Chinese and English.

Responsibilities
Operate and maintain Linux system environments (CentOS / Ubuntu), responsible for system-level troubleshooting and performance optimization;
Maintain and optimize existing Kubernetes clusters, including application deployment and fault troubleshooting;
Build and optimize a monitoring and alerting system based on 
Prometheus + Alertmanager + Grafana
;
Participate in GitLab CI/CD pipelines to enable automated build, test, and release processes;
Operate and maintain common middleware systems, including 
MySQL, Redis, Nginx, Elasticsearch, RocketMQ, Nacos, Etcd
, etc.;
Manage and maintain cloud resources on 
Alibaba Cloud / AWS
, ensuring system security and stability in cloud environments;
Respond promptly to operational incidents (monitoring, security), complete incident resolution end-to-end, and produce standardized SOPs.
Requirements
Core Skills:
3+ years of Linux operations experience;
At least 1 year of Kubernetes operations experience, with familiarity in 
Service Mesh (Istio / ASM)
 traffic governance, canary releases, blue-green deployments, etc.;
At least 1 year of hands-on experience with 
Alibaba Cloud / AWS
;
Solid understanding of CI/CD processes and practical experience with 
GitLab CI
;
Proficient in the deployment and operations of monitoring, alerting, security, and logging systems;
Strong troubleshooting skills with the ability to independently diagnose and resolve issues related to systems, networks, and middleware;
Proficient in at least one programming/scripting language: 
Python, Golang, or Shell
;
Strong ownership mindset with familiarity in operational processes such as incident management and change management.

