protection, by adhering to the company’s Environmental, Health and Safety policies and procedures, and
helping to achieve EHS objectives and targets through participation of EHS programs;
• Participate in any special projects/programs as & when assigned by Company
 
What skills and experiences are we looking:
Diploma/Degree holder in any relevant disciplines;
Fresh graduates are welcome to apply;
Experience in SAP database management is preferred;
Familiar with BOM structure and project planning is preferred.
If you embody the spirit of excellence, passion for discovery, innovation and enterprise, and the desire to make a difference in the world of technology and electronics, come join the Venture team!
 
Be Part of the Global Venture Family.
